sequenceDiagram

  actor 1 as ASM+ User<br />[Person]
  participant 18 as ASM+ Web Application<br />[Container: React, Vite, Node static server]
  participant 13 as Auth Portal<br />[Container: React, Vite, NGINX]
  participant 31 as Auth API<br />[Container: Node.js, TypeScript, Express; port 3000]
  participant 6 as Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL<br />[Software System]

  1->>18: Opens the application<br />[HTTPS]
  18->>13: Redirects to /sso with callback URL<br />[HTTPS]
  1->>13: Submits credentials or starts configured federation<br />[HTTPS]
  13->>31: Authenticates and requests an application token<br />[HTTPS/JSON]
  31->>6: Validates user and application access<br />[PostgreSQL on 127.0.0.1:5432]
  1->>18: Returns to /sso/callback with the token<br />[HTTPS]
  18->>31: Loads identity and access context<br />[HTTPS/JSON, JWT]